    ("h1", "17. The credibility interview"),
    ("p", "A caseworker who has doubts about whether you genuinely intend to study may interview you rather than refuse you outright. The interview is in English, usually by video or telephone with an officer in the UK, and it is not a trick - it is a check that your story is coherent and yours."),
